#ASSERT (`the parental leave position for` casePartner5)'s `partner's leave, in weeks` EQUALS 0
#ASSERT (`the parental leave position for` casePartner5)'s `extended leave still available, in weeks` EQUALS 0
-- S77
#ASSERT (`the parental leave position for` casePartnerNoCare)'s `may take partner's leave` EQUALS FALSE
-- S98
#ASSERT (`the parental leave position for` casePartnerNoCare)'s `extended leave still available, in weeks` EQUALS 0
-- S78
#ASSERT (`the parental leave position for` casePartnerPrevPL)'s `may take partner's leave` EQUALS FALSE
-- S79
#ASSERT (`the parental leave position for` caseMumTransferred)'s `may take partner's leave` EQUALS FALSE
-- S6-partner: s 6 bars partner's leave too (partner's leave is "parental leave")
